        "id": 69044,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-22T15:54:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Popesixtus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b5e925/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Popesixtus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;Is there anything else in the game that gives on-demand DR besides&nbsp;AA's Bulwark?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Hmm. Well, there are a few effects that give temporary reductions, such as Dark Watch Setback's innate power, but it only works for the first attack that would deal damage.</p>\n<p>There are some Environment effects that can grant DR as well, such as the Throne Room in the Time Cataclysm.&nbsp;</p>",
